      "name": "latency-percentiles-from-raw-samples",
      "type": "mini_coding",
      "title": "Find the slow checkouts the average hid",
      "description": "Write latency_report(slo, samples), the report behind Rice Rocket's latency dashboard. From raw request samples, build one row per endpoint (sorted by name) with the count, the average, nearest-rank p50, p95 and p99, the server error rate and whether the endpoint meets its SLO, plus an all row computed from every sample merged together, not by averaging the endpoint rows. The runner prints the report as JSON.",
